<LegalLayout
  title="Aramo Subprocessor List"
  description="This list identifies third parties that may process personal data to provide Aramo or the public Website."
  heading="Aramo Subprocessor List"
>
  <p>This list identifies third parties that may process personal data to provide Aramo or the public Website. A vendor is included when it may receive or access personal data in providing a service to Astre. Vendors used only for source code or development workflows and that do not process customer or candidate personal data are not listed.</p>

  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th>Subprocessor</th>
        <th>Service</th>
        <th>Data / purpose</th>
        <th>Region</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <td>Amazon Web Services, Inc.</td>
        <td>Cloud infrastructure</td>
        <td>Hosting and compute; object storage; tenant authentication; DNS; queues; transactional and intake email delivery. May process platform data and intake email in transit.</td>
        <td>United States</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>Anthropic, PBC</td>
        <td>AI processing</td>
        <td>AI-assisted evidence extraction, assessment drafting, and agent reasoning. May process candidate and professional information submitted for the requested operation.</td>
        <td>United States</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>Google LLC</td>
        <td>Location services</td>
        <td>Address, place, and geography intelligence. May receive location queries, including limited person-adjacent or work-location data.</td>
        <td>United States</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>Microsoft Corporation (Microsoft 365)</td>
        <td>Business communications</td>
        <td>Company mailbox and correspondence, including public Website form submissions delivered to <a href="mailto:hello@aramo.ai">hello@aramo.ai</a>.</td>
        <td>United States</td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <h2>Updates</h2>
  <p>Astre intends to update this list before a new subprocessor begins processing customer, candidate, or visitor personal data. Customer notification and objection rights, if any, are governed by the applicable customer agreement.</p>

  <h2>Questions</h2>
  <p>Questions about subprocessors may be sent to <a href="mailto:hello@aramo.ai">hello@aramo.ai</a>.</p>
</LegalLayout>
